eka.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَقَدْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَرْسَلْنَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d9d7a738bcbe7ccf707c.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "poslali smo", "en": "We sent", "tr": "gönderdik", "fr": "Nous avons envoyé", "id": "Kami utus", "ur": "ہم نے بھیجے", "bn": "আমরা পাঠিয়েছি", "fa": "فرستادیم"}}, {"text": "فِيهِم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُّنذِرِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "71:11", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5430.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He will let loose the sky for you in plenteous rain,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Üzerinize gökten bol yağmur yağdırsın.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تم پر شراٹے کا (موسلا دھار) مینھ بھیجے گا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "niscaya Dia akan mengirimkan hujan kepadamu dengan lebat,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "يُرْسِلِ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/aa29f8aeb2289fb15e1d.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "poslat će", "en": "He will send", "tr": "gönderir", "fr": "Il enverra", "id": "niscaya Dia menurunkan", "ur": "وہ بھیجے گا", "bn": "তিনি পাঠাবেন", "fa": "خواهد فرستاد"}}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمَآءَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَيْكُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّدْرَارًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "26:17", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2949.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "(Saying): Let the Children of Israel go with us.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İsrail oğullarını bizimle beraber gönder.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کہ تو ہما رے ساتھ بنی اسرائیل کو چھوڑ دے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "lepaskanlah Bani Israil (pergi) beserta kami\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "أَنْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَرْسِلْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/c1cfdccd6d22b3540213.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "pusti", "en": "let go, send", "tr": "gönder", "fr": "laisse partir", "id": "lepaskanlah", "ur": "بھیج دے", "bn": "যেতে দাও, পাঠাও", "fa": "رها کن، بفرست"}}, {"text": "مَعَنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَنِىٓ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "105:3", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/6191.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And send against them swarms of flying creatures,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Üzerlerine sürü sürü kuşlar gönderdi.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور ان پر پرندوں کی ٹکڑیاں (فوجیں) بھیجیں", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "dan Dia mengirimkan kapada mereka burung yang berbondong-bondong,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَأَرْسَلَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/313f4ada422c76c8ea25.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "and he/it sent", "bs": "i poslao je", "tr": "ve gönderdi", "fr": "et il a envoyé", "id": "dan dia telah mengutus", "ur": "اور اُس نے بھیجا", "bn": "এবং সে পাঠাল", "fa": "و فرستاد"}}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "طَيْرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَبَابِيلَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "51:33", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4708.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "That we may send upon them stones of clay,", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Onların üzerine çamurdan pişirilmiş sert taşlar yağdıracağız.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "کہ ان پر گارے کے بنائے ہوئے پتھر چھوڑیں،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "agar kami timpakan kepada mereka batu-batu dari tanah,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لِنُرْسِلَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/7a08e5d072f99c9dd91c.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "so that we may send", "bs": "da pošaljemo", "tr": "gönderelim diye", "fr": "que nous envoyions", "id": "agar kami mengutus", "ur": "تاکہ ہم بھیجیں", "bn": "যাতে আমরা পাঠাই", "fa": "تا بفرستیم"}}, {"text": "عَلَيْهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "حِجَارَةً", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "طِينٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "12:45", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1641.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And he of the two who was released, and (now) at length remembered, said: I am going to announce unto you the interpretation, therefore send me forth.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O ikiden kurtulmuş olanı nice zamandan sonra hatırladı da dedi ki: \"Ben size o rüyanın tabirini haber veririm, hemen beni gönderin.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور بولا وہ جو ان دونوں میں سے بچا تھا اور ایک مدت بعد اسے یاد آیا میں تمہیں اس کی تعبیر بتاؤں گا مجھے بھیجو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan berkatalah orang yang selamat diantara mereka berdua dan teringat (kepada Yusuf) sesudah beberapa waktu lamanya: \"Aku akan memberitakan kepadamu tentang (orang yang pandai) mena'birkan mimpi itu, maka utuslah aku (kepadanya)\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَقَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَجَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنْهُمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱدَّكَرَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بَعْدَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أُمَّةٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنَا۠", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أُنَبِّئُكُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِتَأْوِيلِهِۦ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَأَرْسِلُونِ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/6826c0b2342045231d5a.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "so (you all) send me!", "bs": "pa me pošaljite!", "tr": "böylece beni gönderin!", "fr": "alors envoyez-moi !", "id": "maka utuslah aku!", "ur": "پس مجھے بھیجو!", "bn": "অতএব আমাকে পাঠাও!", "fa": "پس مرا بفرستید!"}}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "أَرْسَلْنَا", "count": 41, "first": "2:151", "audio": "audio/d9d7a738bcbe7ccf707c.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "poslali smo", "en": "We sent", "tr": "gönderdik", "fr": "Nous avons envoyé", "id": "Kami utus", "ur": "ہم نے بھیجے", "bn": "আমরা পাঠিয়েছি", "fa": "فرستادیم"}}, {"arabic": "أَرْسَلْنَٰكَ", "count": 12, "first": "2:119", "audio": "audio/3d38cd9b4bf1b4f98117.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": ["anta"]}], "gloss": {"en": "we sent you", "bs": "poslali smo